flowchart LR
  Root[Root package scripts] --> LegacyAPI[server.js legacy API]
  Root --> ReactDev[client React dev server]
  ReactDev -. development proxy port 3001 .-> LegacyAPI
  Static[Root index.html] --> LegacyUI[app.js PDF.js editor]
  LegacyUI --> LocalPDF[Browser PDF preview and form editing]
  ClientEntry[client/src/index.js] --> AppTS[App.tsx per pinned import resolver]
  ClientEntry -. sibling creates resolver ambiguity .-> AppJS[App.js older upload stepper]
  ServerPkg[server/package.json] --> TSAPI[server/src/index.ts separate TS/Mongoose scaffold]
  TSAPI --> Mounted[Auth, templates, API keys, users, logs]
  TSAPI -. does not mount .-> OtherRoutes[PDF, Bubble, field mapping, webhooks modules]
